==Battleground==
*8 [[Sir Rel]]s spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 10~13.33 seconds<sup>300f~400f</sup>.
*2 [[Haniwanwan]]s spawn after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>, delay 20~23.33 seconds<sup>600f~700f</sup>.
*3 [[Mooth]]s spawn after 60 seconds<sup>1,800f</sup>, delay 66.67 seconds<sup>2,000f</sup>.
*6 [[Haniwanwan]]s spawn after 73.33 seconds<sup>2,200f</sup>, delay 16.67~23.33 seconds<sup>500f~700f</sup>.
*1 [[Calamary]] spawns after 86.67 seconds<sup>2,600f</sup>.
*1 [[Relic Bun-Bun]] spawns after 88 seconds<sup>2,640f</sup>.
*1 [[Alpacky]] spawns after 89.33 seconds<sup>2,680f</sup>.
*10 [[Sir Rel]]s spawn after 95.33 seconds<sup>2,860f</sup>, delay 20~23.33 seconds<sup>600f~700f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 75% HP:
**5 [[Sir Rel]]s spawn, delay 0.67~1 seconds<sup>20f~30f</sup>.

==Strategy==
The stage may look scary, but due to all the nasty stuff appearing on timer and the long time they take to do so, this stage is rushable.

To do this, bring cheap, high damage units to kill the Haniwanwans and the base, along with [[Kotatsu Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Octopus Cat]] to block the Haniwanwans' waves. Also bring something to kill the Sir Rels, especially the 5 that spawn in quick succession from base damage; units that are good for this include [[Figure Skating Cats (Super Rare Cat)|Slapstick Cats]], [[Ancient Egg: N101 (Rare Cat)|Courier Cat]], and [[Slime Cat (Rare Cat)|Jelly Dumpling Cat]]. In terms of meatshields, [[Primordial Cat (Rare Cat)|Future Cat]] and [[Maize Cat (Rare Cat)|Maize Cat]] are good, as only relics enemies appear at the beginning.

If you have leftover slots, you can bring starting money or starting level combos.

==Trivia==
